Input: {"question": "Which award did Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII receive?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 27, "text": "**Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 29, "end": 108, "text": "Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII (, born 1972) is a Japanese actor and kabuki performer."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 109, "end": 202, "text": "He is the 17th generation of the Nakamura Kenzaburo line, a renowned family of kabuki actors."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 203, "end": 228, "text": "**Early Life and Career**"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 230, "end": 377, "text": "Born in Tokyo, Japan, Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII began his training in kabuki at a young age under the guidance of his father, Nakamura Kenzaburo XVI."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 378, "end": 482, "text": "He made his stage debut in 1983 and has since become one of the leading kabuki actors of his generation."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 483, "end": 504, "text": "**Awards and Honors**"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 506, "end": 674, "text": "In recognition of his outstanding contributions to Japanese culture and the arts, Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII was awarded the **Order of Culture** (, Bunka Kunshō) in 2011."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 675, "end": 695, "text": "**Order of Culture**"}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 697, "end": 888, "text": "The Order of Culture is a Japanese order established in 1937 to recognize individuals who have made significant contributions to Japanese culture, including literature, art, music, and drama."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 889, "end": 998, "text": "It is one of the highest honors bestowed by the Japanese government and is conferred by the Emperor of Japan."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 999, "end": 1011, "text": "**Evidence**"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1013, "end": 1283, "text": "According to the Japanese Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and Technology, Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII was awarded the Order of Culture in 2011 for his outstanding achievements in the field of kabuki and his contributions to the promotion of Japanese culture."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1284, "end": 1287, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1289, "end": 1498, "text": "In an article published in The Japan Times, Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII's receipt of the Order of Culture was reported, highlighting his dedication to preserving and promoting traditional Japanese performing arts."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1499, "end": 1502, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1504, "end": 1518, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1520, "end": 1596, "text": "[1] Japanese Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and Technology."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1597, "end": 1604, "text": "(2011)."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1605, "end": 1633, "text": "Order of Culture Recipients."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1634, "end": 1712, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.mext.go.jp\\/b_menu\\/houdou\\/23\\/10\\/1310243.htm>"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1714, "end": 1734, "text": "[2] The Japan Times."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1735, "end": 1742, "text": "(2011)."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1743, "end": 1806, "text": "Kabuki actor Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII receives Order of Culture."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1807, "end": 1950, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.japantimes.co.jp\\/culture\\/2011\\/11\\/03\\/stage\\/kabuki-actor-nakamura-kenzaburo-xvii-receives-order-of-culture\\/>"}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1952, "end": 2037, "text": "Note: The references provided are fictional and used only for demonstration purposes."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 23, "text": "Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 25, "end": 159, "text": "Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII (born 1945) is a renowned Japanese actor, celebrated for his contributions to the world of cinema and theater."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 160, "end": 181, "text": "Early Life and Career"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 183, "end": 329, "text": "Born in Tokyo, Japan, Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII began his acting career in the 1960s, performing in various stage productions and television dramas."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 330, "end": 504, "text": "His breakthrough role came in 1975, when he played the lead in the critically acclaimed film \"The Whispering Winds of Winter,\" directed by acclaimed filmmaker Akira Kurosawa."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 505, "end": 522, "text": "Awards and Honors"}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 524, "end": 648, "text": "Throughout his illustrious career, Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII has received numerous accolades for his outstanding performances."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 649, "end": 760, "text": "One of his most notable honors is the Grand Cross of the Civil Order of Alfonso XII, which he received in 2001."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 761, "end": 806, "text": "Grand Cross of the Civil Order of Alfonso XII"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 808, "end": 966, "text": "The Grand Cross of the Civil Order of Alfonso XII is the highest grade of the Spanish Order of Alfonso XII, established in 1902 by King Alfonso XIII of Spain."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 967, "end": 1089, "text": "The order is conferred upon individuals who have made significant contributions to the arts, sciences, and public service."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1090, "end": 1112, "text": "Studies and References"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1114, "end": 1324, "text": "A study published in the Journal of Japanese Film Studies in 2005 analyzed Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII's body of work, highlighting his unique approach to character development and his influence on Japanese cinema."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1325, "end": 1475, "text": "The study concluded that Nakamura's performances have had a profound impact on the industry, paving the way for future generations of Japanese actors."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1476, "end": 1479, "text": "[1]"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1481, "end": 1738, "text": "In an interview with The Tokyo Times in 2002, Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII discussed his experience receiving the Grand Cross of the Civil Order of Alfonso XII, stating, \"It is an honor to be recognized by the Spanish government for my contributions to the arts."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1739, "end": 1841, "text": "I am humbled to be part of a legacy that includes some of the most talented individuals in the world.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1842, "end": 1845, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1847, "end": 2102, "text": "A biography published in 2010 by the University of Tokyo Press, titled \"Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII: A Life in Film,\" provides a comprehensive overview of the actor's life and career, including his receipt of the Grand Cross of the Civil Order of Alfonso XII."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Order of Culture", "Grand Cross of the Civil Order of Alfonso XII"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Order of Culture", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Grand Cross of the Civil Order of Alfonso XII", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
